# Baseline B-19 (F-39): ROUTE that names db "neo4j" answers a routing
# table for that db with ttl 300. Only rt.db and rt.ttl are pinned; the
# servers list (role order) is not.
!: BOLT 4.4
!: AUTO HELLO
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: ROUTE {"address": "localhost:7687"} [] {"db": "neo4j"}
S: SUCCESS {"rt": {"db": "neo4j", "ttl": 300}}
